License scope

The original code and scripts in bbk9588/ are licensed under the MIT License
in bbk9588/LICENSE. The NPE_BBK9588 integration additions to npe-sdl/main.c
are also covered by that license.
The 9588-specific build workflow and the new root documentation are covered
by the same MIT grant.

This grant does not cover the upstream engine, third-party libraries,
extracted native font tables/glyphs, game artwork, screenshots of games,
or the SDK submodule. Their existing terms remain unchanged.

The upstream engine currently has no open-source license grant.
See SOURCE_NOTICE.md for provenance and the exact licensing boundaries.
